# Test + tooling artifacts (never commit)
.playwright-mcp/
graphify-out/

# NOTE: .sgnk/ is intentionally NOT gitignored — snapshots travel with the repo
# so other Claude accounts can /sgnk-recall the resume KEY card.

# Derived documents. The tree under docs/ is the source; these are projections of it,
# rebuilt by `npm run doc` and `npm run pdf`. Committing them means the repo carries two
# copies of the same words that can disagree — which is the exact failure the product
# exists to prevent, so we do not do it to ourselves.
docs/FRONTMATTER-RECORD.md
docs/*.print.html
docs/print-test.pdf
docs/frontmatter-COMPLETE-RECORD-*.md
